sumed. Get 3GB per day for 3 days at Rs. 39. Recharge now i.airtel.in/dtpck-pre\",\"sender\":\"AT-AIRTEL-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793812802125\":{\"dateTime\":\"04-11-2026 | 10:50 pm\",\"id\":1793812802125,\"message\":\"Alert 100%: for your daily high speed data limit. Get 3GB per day for 3 days at Rs. 39. Recharge now i.airtel.in/dtpck-pre\",\"sender\":\"AT-AIRTEL-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793812802890\":{\"dateTime\":\"04-11-2026 | 10:50 pm\",\"id\":1793812802890,\"message\":\"ഡാറ്റ കഴിഞ്ഞോ? അധിക ചെലവില്ലാതെ 1GB ഡാറ്റ ലോൺ നേടൂ. ഡാറ്റ വാലിഡിറ്റി - 1 ദിവസം. പ്രയോജനപ്പെടുത്തുന്നതിന് *567*3# ഡയൽ ചെയ്യുക അല്ലെങ്കിൽ 1 എന്ന് റിപ്ലേ നൽകുക. താങ്കളുടെ അടുത്ത ഡാറ്റ റീചാർജിൽ1GB കുറവായിരിക്കും.\",\"sender\":\"56321\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793850918852\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 09:25 am\",\"id\":1793850918852,\"message\":\"Reminder: Your Airtel pack is ending on 08-Nov-2026. Recharge today to continue enjoying your services; click i.airtel.in/rcdn_fdp. Please ignore if already done.\",\"sender\":\"AL-AIRTEL-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793853102098\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 10:01 am\",\"id\":1793853102098,\"message\":\"Your Airtel pack on 8714XXX989 is about to expire! Recharge with Rs. 399 & get unlimited calls, Unlimited 4G + 5G data on all handsets & 100 SMS/day, for 28 days. Please ignore if already recharged. https://i.airtel.in/rc399pre\",\"sender\":\"AL-650001-P\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793862144752\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 12:32 pm\",\"id\":1793862144752,\"message\":\"India's first Prepaid Family Plan is here! Add members from anywhere in India, share data & get up to 10% OFF on recharges. https://viapp.onelink.me/bSC3/FM9\",\"sender\":\"VL-612345-P\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793868176273\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 02:12 pm\",\"id\":1793868176273,\"message\":\"LOGIN to your Flipkart account using OTP 557238. DO NOT SHARE this code with anyone, including delivery agents. #557238\",\"sender\":\"VA-FLPKRT-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1