ys\\r\\n\\r\\nVisit gftr.it/epay to download the GyFTR ePAY App. Use your e-Pay at www.gyftr.com to shop for 550+ brand Vouchers.\\r\\n\\r\\nHappy shopping!\",\"sender\":\"AD-GYFTRR-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1794016511593\":{\"dateTime\":\"07-11-2026 | 07:25 am\",\"id\":1794016511593,\"message\":\"Debit Alert!\\n\\nThank you for using GYFTR VOUCHER-PAY. INR 48.00 has been debited.\\n\\nUpdated Balance:  0.00\\nValidity: Nov 07, 2027\\n\\nTo MANAGE your account or any HELP/DISPUTE visit https://gftr.it/GYFTRR/gyftr or call 1800-1033-314\\n\\nGYFTR VOUCHER-PAY Powered by GyFTR\",\"sender\":\"JK-GYFTRR-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"}}"},"redirectURL":"","headersSize":306,"bodySize":6311,"_status":"completed","_startTimestamp":1794026802523163,"_endTimestamp":1794026802530926},"cache":{},"timings":{"send":-1,"wait":-1,"receive":-1},"serverIPAddress":"2600:1901:0:4d00::","connection":"1","comment":"","_id":116,"_uid":"b15a7998-c3e2-4841-941f-e662b43cd0d4","_cid":1,"_ctime":1794026744074,"_sid":25,"_stime":1794026802155,"_serverAddress":"2600:1901:0:4d00::","_serverAddressFamily":1,"_serverPort":443,"_clientAddress":"127.0.0.1","_clientAddressFamily":0,"_clientPort":43082},{"startedDateTime":"2026-11-07T04:46:42.154Z","time":530,"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://rahul1-15f7c-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com/messages/41fcca374d2a2371.json?auth=Ehe&orderBy=%22%24key%22&limitToLast=150","httpVersion":"HTTP/1.1","cookies":[],"headers":[{"name":"Host","value":"rahul1-15f7c-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com"},{"name":"Connection","value":"keep-alive"},{"name":"sec-ch-ua-platform","value":"\"Android\""},{"name":"User-Agent","value":"Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 16; SM-E156B Build/BP2A.250605.031.A3) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.8103.38 Mobile Safari/537.36"},{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json"},{"name":"sec-ch-ua","value":"\"Not-A.Brand\";v=\"99\", \"Android WebView\";v=\"157\", \"Chromium\";v=\"157\""},{"name":"sec-ch-ua-mobile","value":"?1"},{"name":"Or