డా శిక్షార్హమే. దయచేసి టెలికాం సేవలను బాధ్యతాయుతంగా వినియోగించండి.\",\"sender\":\"AD-ARWGOV-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793869065419\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 02:27 pm\",\"id\":1793869065419,\"message\":\"LOGIN to your Flipkart account using OTP 673516. DO NOT SHARE this code with anyone, including delivery agents. #673516\",\"sender\":\"VM-FLPKRT-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793876284374\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 04:28 pm\",\"id\":1793876284374,\"message\":\"Your Airtel rewards are waiting! Claim them instantly via Airtel app https://i.airtel.in/freereward_5\",\"sender\":\"AA-AIRTEL-P\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793896643066\":{\"dateTime\":\"05-11-2026 | 10:07 pm\",\"id\":1793896643066,\"message\":\"అంతర్జాతీయ కాల్ ని స్వీకరించినప్పుడు, ఇండియన్ నెంబర్ ఐతే లేదా మీ ఫోన్లో నెంబర్ కనిపించక పొతే , దయచేసి DoT టోల్ ఫ్రీ నంబర్ 1800110420/1963 కు తెలియజేయండి.\",\"sender\":\"AD-AIRDOT-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793904794089\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 12:23 am\",\"id\":1793904794089,\"message\":\"[#] 615179 is your LOGIN OTP for Flipkart. DO NOT SHARE this code with anyone, including Flipkart delivery agents.\\r\\nDf9YrqIZHWd\",\"sender\":\"VA-FLPKRT-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793904795885\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 12:23 am\",\"id\":1793904795885,\"message\":\"<#> Please use OTP 9722 to login to your Blinkit (formerly grofers) account and shop from our wide array of products. OTP valid for 5 minutes h2i2dXfT8qL\",\"sender\":\"CP-blnkit-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793906967484\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 12:59 am\",\"id\":1793906967484,\"message\":\"LOGIN to your Flipkart account using OTP 699843. DO NOT SHARE this code with anyone, including delivery agents. #699843\",\"sender\":\"VA-FLPKRT-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793907066588\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 01:01 am\",\"id\":1793907066588,\"message\":\"Use OTP 813511 to log into your Swiggy account. Do not share the OTP or your number with anyone including Swiggy personnel. ASkSzFWMk3x\