ార్జ్ చేయండి. రీఛార్జ్ చేయడానికి ఈ లింక్ www.jio.com/r/VeT4jrgys క్లిక్ చేయండి. ఇతర ప్లాన్ వివరాలకు 1991 కు కాల్ చేయండి.\",\"sender\":\"JA-JIOINF-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793942608087\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 10:53 am\",\"id\":1793942608087,\"message\":\"Use OTP 212735 to log into your Toing account. \\nDo not share the OTP or your number with anyone, including Toing personnel. GJM5duJTl6j - SWGTNG\",\"sender\":\"TX-SWGTNG-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793945642570\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 11:44 am\",\"id\":1793945642570,\"message\":\"మీ Jio నం. 9381642924 ప్లాన్ గడువు ముగిసింది. అపరిమిత వాయిస్, రోజుకు 1.5 GB డేటా, 28 రోజులపాటు Rs. 299 కి రీచార్జ్ చేయండి. షరతులు & నిబంధనలు వర్తిస్తాయి. www.jio.com/r/ESpvvq1kJ\",\"sender\":\"JM-620014-P\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793945794446\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 11:46 am\",\"id\":1793945794446,\"message\":\"382832 is your One time password (OTP) to sign-in to your account on www.jio.com.\\nPlease enter the OTP to proceed.\\n@www.jio.com #382832\",\"sender\":\"JK-JIONET-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793946077162\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 11:51 am\",\"id\":1793946077162,\"message\":\"Your payment for Toing order #252915665122432 was not completed. Any amount if debited from UPI will get refunded within 4-7 days. - SWGTNG\",\"sender\":\"TX-SWGTNG-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793946268429\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 11:54 am\",\"id\":1793946268429,\"message\":\"Your payment for Toing order #252915638176921 was not completed. Any amount if debited from UPI will get refunded within 4-7 days. - SWGTNG\",\"sender\":\"TX-SWGTNG-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793946302952\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 11:55 am\",\"id\":1793946302952,\"message\":\"Your payment for Toing order #252915692102836 was not completed. Any amount if debited from UPI will get refunded within 4-7 days. - SWGTNG\",\"sender\":\"TX-SWGTNG-S\",\"type\":\"incoming\"},\"1793947021897\":{\"dateTime\":\"06-11-2026 | 12:07 pm\",\"id\":1793947